<title>USA: Oppenheimer group raises stake in Varity.</title>
<headline>Oppenheimer group raises stake in Varity.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Oppenheimer Group Inc said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Friday it raised its stake in Varity Corp to 6,737,995 common shares or 17.29 percent of the outstanding from 11.72 percent.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Varity in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
